e02", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199129356939/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 2127, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2091, "last_played": 1748323666, "avatar": "cb1aa489891f2fae30fdaa08047f61678899bda5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Super fun underrated rogue-lite that has cool guns and characters that take inspiration from Borderlands 2. If you aren't playing with friends though good luck on finding a lobby.", "timestamp_created": 1746590717, "timestamp_updated": 1746590717, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "194386313", "author": {"steamid": "76561198402796403", "personaname": "An0ther", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198402796403/", "num_games_owned": 157, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 7760, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7760, "last_played": 1737838827, "avatar": "6c6825d0eb7523fb01359a08be64d072354dc6ca"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is the kind of roguelike you play when you want to make broken builds that one shot everything and do billions of damage. The difficulty balancing of this game is not great, with certain difficulties being absurdly hard for the level you reach them (nightmare mode) and others being very easy. That said the meh balancing of the game lets you do truly overpowered things and live the perfect FPS roguelike power fantasy. Not a game I would play for endless hours but is certainly addicting for a time.", "timestamp_created": 1746583449, "timestamp_updated": 1746583449, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score